# State
# state/processed/*.json is deliberately NOT ignored: the records are the
# idempotence, and ignoring them kept it local to one machine. One small file
# per link, so two machines ingesting different links never conflict.
# Extracted pivots waiting to be curated. A queue, not an archive: regenerable
# and local to whichever machine holds the GPU.
state/pivots/
# Cover images kept for the curator to eyeball. Media, never committed.
state/covers/

